  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "start",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "The control room. Eighteen degrees. Forty people pressed against the walls. Everyone who still has a stake.",
      "next": "f1"
    },
    {
      "id": "f1",
      "speaker": "roz",
      "text": "The Floor fed this city for a year. We run it as a kitchen. Everybody eats. Everybody works.",
      "next": "f2"
    },
    {
      "id": "f2",
      "speaker": "avila",
      "text": "Without a count, you feed everyone for a month and then no one. Give me the plant. I'll keep a list. An honest one.",
      "next": "f3"
    },
    {
      "id": "f3",
      "speaker": "ander",
      "text": "Galena heats three hundred. Fallon's geothermal field could heat a thousand of ours. The turbines come east.",
      "next": "f4"
    },
    {
      "id": "f4",
      "speaker": "carly",
      "text": "Or we don't hand it to anyone. We sit at one table and fight about it every night. Names on the wall. All of them.",
      "next": "f5"
    },
    {
      "id": "f5",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "They look at you. You lit it. They want you to say who it's for.",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "A council. All of us. Every night.",
          "next": "council",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "flag": "kindness",
              "gte": 5
            },
            {
              "flag": "dam_running",
              "eq": true
            }
          ],
          "effects": [
            {
              "set": "final_choice",
              "value": "council"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Avila keeps the count.",
          "next": "authority",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "flag": "avila_alive",
              "eq": true
            }
          ],
          "effects": [
            {
              "set": "final_choice",
              "value": "authority"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The turbines go east. Fallon.",
          "next": "compact",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "flag": "ander_alive",
              "eq": true
            }
          ],
          "effects": [
            {
              "set": "final_choice",
              "value": "compact"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nobody. I'm shutting it down.",
          "next": "shutdown",
          "effects": [
            {
              "set": "final_choice",
              "value": "shutdown"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "[Say nothing. Leave tonight]",
          "next": "leave",
          "effects": [
            {
              "set": "final_choice",
              "value": "leave"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "council",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "The room explodes. Shouting. Then, slowly, chairs dragged into a circle.",
      "next": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "id": "authority",
      "speaker": "avila",
      "text": "Thank you. I'll read the list aloud every Sunday. Including the names I cross off.",
      "next": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "id": "compact",
      "speaker": "ander",
      "text": "Your father will be proud. The city will curse you. Both will be right.",
      "next": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "id": "shutdown",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "Silence. Then Carly, quietly: 'Okay. Then we walk. Together.'",
      "next": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "id": "leave",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "You don't say anything. Later, when the room is empty, you start packing.",
      "next": "resolve"
    },
